Since April, people have told us their bookings land on the wrong day: a month flipped. By
4 October the desk had **412 reports**.

**Merged as one issue — then split.** Cause grouping shows two mechanisms. See
[two problems under one ticket](/kb/incidents/4471-two-problems).

<Callout>
Closed 05 Oct. parser fixed (`fix(dates): parse dd/mm for eu locales`). hint won't fix
(booking-v3 form retired).
